# Demo credentials (local only)

Copy to `docs/demo-credentials.local.md` and keep that file private.

Set `DEMO_SEED_PASSWORD` in your environment (or `.env`). Never commit the password.

Public live demo login does not display passwords. Visitors use **Try Live Demo** and pick a persona.

| Role | Email |
|------|--------|
| Admin | admin@demo.algoscrm.test |
| Sales Manager | manager@demo.algoscrm.test |
| Sales Representative | sales@demo.algoscrm.test |

Company: Northstar Solutions (`northstar-solutions`)
